      "message": "Whoops. I saw \"888x\" and ran with it.\n\ninclude/core/SkAlphaType.h says \"If SkAlphaType is kOpaque_SkAlphaType, and SkColorType is not opaque, then the result of drawing any pixel with a alpha value less than 1.0 is undefined.\" However, it looks like SkPngEncoderBase::getTargetInfo() and SkPngRustEncoderImpl::Make() handle kOpaque_SkAlphaType correctly. So could you give it a try?",
